Fique aqui.

964
00:49:50,057 --> 00:49:52,226
-Porra.

965
00:49:57,030 --> 00:49:58,700
Ei.

966
00:50:13,280 --> 00:50:15,015
Celina.

967
00:50:15,115 --> 00:50:16,718
Celina!

968
00:50:16,818 --> 00:50:19,486
Olá! Olá!

969
00:50:19,587 --> 00:50:21,021
-Celina! Celina!!

970
00:50:21,121 --> 00:50:25,025
Celina! Ei! Ei!

971
